<title>USA: Compdent names Phyllis Klock president.</title>
<headline>Compdent names Phyllis Klock president.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompDent Corp said Friday that it elected Phyllis Klock president, effective January 1.</p>
<p>Klock is executive vice president with significant operational responsibilities.  She has been associated with the company since 1980 when she was hired as a consultant to the then-Florida-based organization.  In 1986 she joined the company as vice president.  In 1993 she was promoted to senior vice president and in 1995 was promoted to executive vice president.</p>
</text>
